{"title":"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/6/186e5a84ff46329a41ebbb5875fc234527739481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 5, BC = 7, CA = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" />. Denote by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> the circumcenter and incenter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. The incircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> touches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/46569d6dd3fa86f698827e8de15b0480e1733d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> intersects the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb41372c0ceb75395068930b9d6374b2fbc370fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AID$\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> again at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />. Then the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/5963de05f34cb128fe0d4cf64d5f8e9c06895f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DK$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> can be expressed in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/6/4666ec1610bb241e705254e73d34322120f3ab3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m \\sqrt n}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"44\" height=\"42\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f12de85201fe816ff4700b0c3f0a848a6c413c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n, p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"11\" /> are positive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are relatively prime, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is not divisible by the square of any prime. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a61870035304b46bdbcafc39d04bea20e3899c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n+p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Analytic geometry gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3fb397b5c4c9f687930cd3dd4528a8fcbaec15f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[DK=\\frac{17\\sqrt{57}}{19}.\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"41\" /> The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I\" title=\"2020 CIME I\">2020 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 CIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012944\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 170/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1479/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 112/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3474/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.955      1 -total\n 74.50%    8.161      1 Template:CIME_box\n 22.07%    2.418      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19616:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012944 and revision id 132946. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}